      objective: "<b>Room 3  \xB7  worst case:</b>  the shelf is in <b>reverse order</b>:  every book travels all the way.\n<b>Insertion sort</b> the books on the shelf, smallest number first.\nPull out the glowing book;  <b>shift</b> a bigger left neighbour right (click it),  or <b>place</b> the book (click it).\n<size=20>Click the glowing book or press F  \xB7  click the glowing spot or press its number  \xB7  H hint</size>"
