    - number: 2
      sortCase: 2
      objective: "<b>Room 2  \xB7  average case:</b>  the blocks are in <b>random order</b>.\n<b>Merge sort</b> the data blocks, smallest first.\nPress <b>SPLIT</b> until every block stands alone.  Then merge two runs at a time:  always take the <b>smaller front block</b>.\n<size=20>Q split  \xB7  click a glowing front block, or press 1 (left) / 2 (right)  \xB7  H hint</size>"
      puzzle: {fileID: 586390603}
      exitDoor: {fileID: 342415029}
