    - number: 2
      sortCase: 2
      objective: "<b>Room 2  \xB7  average case:</b>  the bars are in <b>random order</b>.\n<b>Quick sort</b> the gold bars, smallest first.\nRaise the <b>pivot</b> (the last bar).  Every other bar:  <b>smaller</b> goes behind the gate,  <b>bigger</b> stays.  Then drop the pivot into its place.\n<size=20>P pivot  \xB7  1 smaller  \xB7  2 bigger  \xB7  H hint</size>"
      puzzle: {fileID: 2072942657}
      exitDoor: {fileID: 1794734137}
      entrance: {fileID: 481393019}
      root: {fileID: 1672517743}
