      exitInside: {x: 11.4, y: 0, z: 0.6999999}
      exitOutside: {x: 11.4, y: 0, z: 3.5}
    - number: 3
      sortCase: 3
      objective: "<b>Room 3  \xB7  worst case:</b>  the bars are <b>already sorted</b>:  every pivot is the biggest!\n<b>Quick sort</b> the gold bars, smallest first.\nRaise the <b>pivot</b> (the last bar).  Every other bar:  <b>smaller</b> goes behind the gate,  <b>bigger</b> stays.  Then drop the pivot into its place.\n<size=20>P pivot  \xB7  1 smaller  \xB7  2 bigger  \xB7  H hint</size>"
      puzzle: {fileID: 1331156643}
